    <div class="card">
      <p class="eyebrow">Mission</p>
      <p class="lede" style="max-width:none">Tabeebna is dedicated to empowering young people through events, internships, and opportunities, focusing not only on medicine but on all fields, to inspire a generation of skilled, compassionate, and global-minded leaders, as well as raising awareness and funds to be able to provide to those in need.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <p class="eyebrow">Vision</p>
      <p class="lede" style="max-width:none">To be a bridge that empowers the youth with knowledge, compassion, and global awareness to create leaders who bring positive change, uplifting those in need.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

