        <div>
          <span class="event-card__date">January 8, 2026</span>
          <h3>Tabeebna Kickoff</h3>
          <p>Tabeebna's Kickoff brought together high school students from all over Bahrain, drawing around 350 attendees for a night built around heated football matches that brought out the true spirit of the game and set the tone for the evening's captivating atmosphere. Although football wasn't the only thing that caught people's attention, a handful of booths and vendors, including Education Zone and INJAZ teams Hawin and Lawen gave the event its energy, while the photobooth stayed busy all night, capturing the kind of spontaneous moments students will always remember.</p>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="event-card">
        <div class="event-card__photo-placeholder">Event photos<br>coming soon</div>
        <div>
          <span class="event-card__date">October 16, 2025</span>
          <h3>Think Pink</h3>
          <p>For Breast Cancer Awareness Month, Tabeebna set up an interactive stand at Modern Knowledge School, built around a Flower Bar and trivia games with prizes that kept students stopping by. Beyond the fun, the event gave Tabeebna a platform to advocate for those affected by cancer, with all proceeds going toward funding future charitable initiatives.</p>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="event-card">
        <div class="event-card__photo-placeholder">Event photos<br>coming soon</div>
        <div>
          <span class="event-card__date">November 22, 2025</span>
          <h3>Bazaar Volunteer Event</h3>
          <p>Tabeebna partnered with OneHeart and Al Hilal Hospital for their Community One Heart event, spending two days sorting and packing donated clothing and toys for families in need. It was a hands-on reminder of what community-driven care looks like in practice, and a chance for the team to give back in a completely different format than our usual events.</p>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="event-card">
        <div class="event-card__photo-placeholder">Event photos<br>coming soon</div>
        <div>
          <span class="event-card__date">February 6, 2026</span>
          <h3>7iraf Kick-off</h3>
          <p>Tabeebna joined the 7iraf Kick-off tournament, using the football event as a platform to promote our initiative alongside various INJAZ booths. Between the matches and the networking, the tournament's energy gave the team a genuine backdrop to build new connections and push our community outreach further.</p>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="event-card">
        <div class="event-card__photo-placeholder">Event photos<br>coming soon</div>
        <div>
          <span class="event-card__date">August 30, 2025</span>
          <h3>Tabeebna x KIMSHealth Workshop</h3>
          <p>Tabeebna teamed up with KIMSHealth for a hands-on workshop centered on diabetes awareness, giving students a chance to learn the basics directly from healthcare professionals. The day included blood testing and certificates for attendees, rounding out an event that mixed real medical exposure with a welcoming, low pressure environment to ask questions and connect with people already working in the field.</p>
